From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:37:42 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): add Material 3 Expressive variant with spring
 motion

Add Variant::Material, a tonal palette generated from the accent colour,
and a spring helper in motion.rs. The switch uses the Material 52x32 track
with a spring-driven handle, and inline buttons morph from pill to a squarer
radius while pressed. Other presets keep their current geometry.

Not compiled against the full workspace: the palette math and spring
convergence were checked in a standalone harness only.

